{
    "title": "4 Pics Puzzles: guess word",
    "description": "4 Pics Puzzles: guess word is a very popular picture word game recently.\r\nIt can help you relax, exercise your association ability, and help you learn vocabulary.\r\n\r\nHow to play\r\n\u2022 First observe the 4 pictures given to find the connection between them\r\n\u2022 Four pictures will point to one word, find the correct word\r\n\u2022 Click on the letters given below to spell out your answer\r\n\u2022 It doesn\u2019t matter if you make a mistake, click on the letter in the box to undo them\r\n\r\nGame features\r\n\u2022 Simple but very interesting gameplay!\r\n\u2022 You can play anytime, anywhere, even without the internet!\r\n\u2022 3000+ levels, and will be constantly updated, let you play enough!\r\n\u2022 You can use props to help you pass levels faster!\r\n\r\nWhat are you waiting for? Invite your friends to play the 4 Pics Puzzles: guess word, see who can guess the hidden words in the picture, quickly pass the levels, and win rewards!",
    "descriptionHTML": "4 Pics Puzzles: guess word is a very popular picture word game recently.<br>It can help you relax, exercise your association ability, and help you learn vocabulary.<br><br>How to play<br>\u2022 First observe the 4 pictures given to find the connection between them<br>\u2022 Four pictures will point to one word, find the correct word<br>\u2022 Click on the letters given below to spell out your answer<br>\u2022 It doesn\u2019t matter if you make a mistake, click on the letter in the box to undo them<br><br>Game features<br>\u2022 Simple but very interesting gameplay!<br>\u2022 You can play anytime, anywhere, even without the internet!<br>\u2022 3000+ levels, and will be constantly updated, let you play enough!<br>\u2022 You can use props to help you pass levels faster!<br><br>What are you waiting for? Invite your friends to play the 4 Pics Puzzles: guess word, see who can guess the hidden words in the picture, quickly pass the levels, and win rewards!",
